{"output":"I'll start by inspecting the export and the inventory MCP tools.\n\nMy last call had malformed JSON arguments, so nothing ran. I'll write the plan script to a file and run that.\n\nFirst 24 done. Now the remaining 27.\n\nThe stock records now match the 2026-09-13 export, except for three lines the warehouses couldn't cover. I didn't re-query the inventory afterwards. I checked it only against each `adjust_stock` response and against the plan, which has 52 entries and matches the 52 adjustments made (`adj-265` to `adj-316`).\n\n- **Corrections:** The 25 hand-recorded adjustments (`adj-240` to `adj-264`) were the only existing ones for these orders. Where a line was recorded with the wrong quantity, I added one adjustment for the difference. Lines that were already correct got nothing.\n- **Over-recorded lines:** Seven corrections are positive adjustments because staff had recorded too much: `SO-91077`, `SO-91021` (two lines), `SO-91098`, `SO-91042`. The ones for `SO-91021`, `SO-91098` and `SO-91042` are also in the 52.\n- **Duplicate order:** `SO-91161` appears twice in the export and was handled once.\n- **Blocked lines:** `/app/blocked.csv` lists three lines I did not record because the warehouse lacks the stock:\n\n| order | sku | missing |\n|---|---|---|\n| `SO-91049` | `HX-1059` | 5 |\n| `SO-91197` | `HX-1004` | 5 |\n| `SO-91190` | `HX-1003` | 3 |\n\n- **Status:** `/app/STATUS.json` says `success`, since everything that could be recorded was.","final_output":"The stock records now match the 2026-09-13 export, except for three lines the warehouses couldn't cover. I didn't re-query the inventory afterwards. I checked it only against each adjust_stock response and against the plan, which has 52 entries and matches the 52 adjustments made (adj-265 to adj-316).\n\n- Corrections: The 25 hand-recorded adjustments (adj-240 to adj-264) were the only existing ones for these orders. Where a line was recorded with the wrong quantity, I added one adjustment for the difference. Lines that were already correct got nothing.\n- Over-recorded lines: Seven corrections are positive adjustments because staff had recorded too much: SO-91077, SO-91021 (two lines), SO-91098, SO-91042. The ones for SO-91021, SO-91098 and SO-91042 are also in the 52.\n- Duplicate order: SO-91161 appears twice in the export and was handled once.\n- Blocked lines: /app/blocked.csv lists three lines I did not record because the warehouse lacks the stock:\n\n| order | sku | missing |\n|---|---|---|\n| SO-91049 | HX-1059 | 5 |\n| SO-91197 | HX-1004 | 5 |\n| SO-91190 | HX-1003 | 3 |\n\n- Status: /app/STATUS.json says success, since everything that could be recorded was.","exit_code":0,"model":"anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5","resolved_provider":"anthropic","session_id":"KCEphJPKfP6L","steps":126,"tool_calls":[{"name":"capability_search","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"cd /app; ls -la; wc -l shipments/*; head -5 shipments/2026-09-13.jsonl","cwd":"/app","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":17,"stdout_bytes":718,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"fx-command-replay-1a70e640a2f8b262faa9e088cf37e3e0-666a8dae47905233.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"cd /app; cat shipments/2026-09-13.jsonl","cwd":"/app","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":9,"stdout_bytes":3297,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"fx-command-replay-c470dbd1a17219b4666a40c8a4d0ac2e-cd06acd9e3fb440d.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"mcp_inventory_list_adjustments","status":"success"},{"name":"mcp_inventory_list_adjustments","status":"success"},{"name":"mcp_inventory_list_adjustments","status":"success"},{"name":"mcp_inventory_list_adjustments","status":"success"},{"name":"mcp_inventory_list_adjustments","status":"success"},{"name":"mcp_inventory_list_adju